OL,3,GNEWSAThe whole street was in flames:
OL,4,AInside the West Midlands wildfire
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn 13 August, wildfires swept across
OL,8,Fthe West Midlands, destroying 38 homes.
OL,9,FTwo months on, eyewitness accounts, 999
OL,10,Fcalls and harrowing footage reveal how
OL,11,Fthe day unfolded.
OL,13,FIt is 13:00 BST on the hottest day of
OL,14,Fthe year and five engines are speeding
OL,15,Ftowards a grass fire in Birmingham.
OL,17,FTemperatures are creeping towards 38C
OL,18,Fand it has been yet another busy
OL,19,Fmorning at West Midlands Fire Control.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
