OL,3,GNEWSAThe whole street was in flames:
OL,4,AInside the West Midlands wildfire
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut within minutes, the switchboard is
OL,8,Fjammed with panicked calls about
OL,9,Fwildfires in fields and parks that are
OL,10,Fmoving dangerously close to homes.
